        <p>The marriage of Captain T. Itidgway, 4th South Lancashire Regiment, at present home on short leavie from Frailbe, the elder and only surviving- -seal of Mr. and • Mrs. Ridgway, of Wildersmoor, %Limrn, Cheshire, and Miss Edith Winifred Grundy, youngest -.daughter of the late Mr. and Mrs: Thomas Grundy,. of Lyman, Cheshire, took place- Very quietly On Thursday at the Holy Trinity Church,. Prince ConsortrFoad, •Kensington ; -London, the Rev: H. B: Coward? Vial. Ofrthn'parish;.ofliciating: • ' MaVil'C'.."ll`.i.Carf,c'alsdot the 4th Sotith Larws:, raA' tile •lieA man• _ . _</p>
