        <p>TO-DAY'S MATCHES.</p>
        <p>At Wilderspool.</p>
        <p>St. Mary's v. St. Thomas' Kick-off 3 o'clock. Referee, J. Beardsall. Parochial v. St. James'. Kick-off 4 o'clock. Referee, G. Crozier.</p>
